  "scope": "Explicit x.29 policy in prepared SKY130 platforms, physical settings, Finish and export. Actual application entry points on unchanged filled counter/UART/APB plus Windows/Linux worker, failure, export and compatibility tests. Bulk mode is NOT_REQUESTED, never a passing isolation check.",
